{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 13, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the moment I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the vibrant culture and rich history that permeates every aspect of Japanese life.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Fish Market in Tokyo. Watching the fishermen auction off the day's catch was a thrilling experience, and sampling some of the freshest sushi I've ever had was a culinary delight.\n\nI also had the opportunity to visit the serene Fushimi Inari shrine in Kyoto, famous for its thousands of vermilion torii gates that form a tunnel up the mountain. The peaceful atmosphere and stunning scenery made for a truly spiritual experience.\n\nIn addition to its cultural and historical attractions, Japan is also a country of cutting-edge technology and innovation. I was amazed by the futuristic gadgets and robots on display at the Miraikan science museum in Tokyo, and I was impressed by the efficiency and reliability of the country's public transportation system.\n\nOverall, my trip to Japan was a fascinating and enriching experience that left me with a deep appreciation for this unique and captivating country. From its ancient traditions to its modern innovations, Japan has something to offer for every interest and curiosity. I look forward to returning one day and exploring more of what this incredible country has to offer.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.4636104702949524}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.004141089040786028}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -5.602820692729438e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.437280717364047e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.25465595722198486}, {"token": " truly", "logprob": -0.6400582194328308}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.0003489